{"id":"d26cc51faa7eb460","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-prop-cofinality.md","title":"Cofinality Properties","display":"prop-cofinality — Cofinality Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-cofinality","aliases":["58-prop-cofinality"],"display":"prop-cofinality — Cofinality Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-cofinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-cofinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-cofinality — Cofinality Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa) \\leq \\kappa \\land \\mathrm{cf}(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)) = \\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa) \\leq \\kappa \\land \\mathrm{cf}(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)) = \\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cofinality of any cardinal is at most the cardinal itself.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> is always a regular cardinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (基数, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (cofinality operator, see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa) \\leq \\kappa \\land \\mathrm{cf}(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)) = \\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":824,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3946","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-prop-cofinality.md|58-prop-cofinality]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}